                  <photoshop:LayerText>Shritee Ghosh</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>She has been associated with several equity and debt capital ma</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>She has been associated with several equity and debt capital market transactions. She also advises on matters relating to compliance with Securities Regulation such as compliance with Listing Requirements. She has hands on experience in Company Law matters along with the FEMA compliances.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>She regularly advises clients with respect to general corporate</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>She regularly advises clients with respect to general corporate matters, transactional matters and is extensively engaged in regulatory advisory. She has experience in handling day-to-day secretarial compliance of the companies incorporated in India particularly having foreign investments, downstream investments, etc. She has been involved in providing legal opinions and advice to the clients on the corporate laws.</photoshop:LayerText>
