         <photoshop:TextLayers>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Our Team</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Our Team</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Bhupendra Dave </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Bhupendra Dave </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Bhavana Chandak</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Bhavana Chandak</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Advocate | Company Secretary</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Advocate | Company Secretary</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Advocate </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Advocate </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Is the Founding and Managing partner of Naavick Legal, and is a</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Is the Founding and Managing partner of Naavick Legal, and is a practicing Advocate, having forte in transaction advisory and litigation. Having in-depth knowledge and expertise in Securities Laws, IBC and Companies Act and is regularly appearing before NCLT, SAT and other regulatory bodies and tribunals.  Recently been a part of few of complex commercial transactions including IPO, M&amp;A, Insolvency and Restructuring and Promoter Settlements.  With more than a decade of experience in understanding of law and regulatory matters, coupled with knowledge of finance, accounts, and business enables him to provide holistic advice on transaction and litigation matters. He has been consistently recognised for building Naavick Legal into an emerging corporate legal firm, in Mumbai. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>She actively pursues the ever-evolving jurisprudence relating t</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>She actively pursues the ever-evolving jurisprudence relating to the Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code, 2016 and takes keen interest in critically analysing the development of law in this field. Her understanding of the jurisprudence has helped in successfully advising the entire gamut of stakeholders on a wide range of insolvency issues. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Lorem Ipsum</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Lorem Ipsum</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Lorem Ipsum</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Lorem Ipsum</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
            </rdf:Bag>
         </photoshop:TextLayers>
