               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Guiding clients through the SME IPO process, ensuring SEBI ICDR</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Guiding clients through the SME IPO process, ensuring SEBI ICDR compliance  Assessing eligibility, engaging intermediaries, conducting due diligence, and preparing the DRHP  Managing SEBI observations, roadshows, price fixation, share allotment, and listing  Ensuring post-IPO compliance and investor communicatio</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
