                  <photoshop:LayerName>Strategic support for corporate transactions including acquisit</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Strategic support for corporate transactions including acquisitions and joint ventures  Multidisciplinary approach incorporating tax, compliance, and disputes  Ensuring exceptional client experience throughout M&amp;A transactions</photoshop:LayerText>
