                  <photoshop:LayerText>Services in trademark, patent, copyright, and design laws  Availability searches, filings, prosecution, registrations, and renewals  Domain name registrations, design filings, and litigations  Protecting trade secrets, handling assignments and license agreements</photoshop:LayerText>
