                  <photoshop:LayerName>With over 12 years of expertise in Corporate and Securities Law</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>With over 12 years of expertise in Corporate and Securities Laws, including extensive work in IBC, Capital Market, and Start-up ecosystem for the past 7 years, Bhupendra Dave, an Advocate and qualified Company Secretary, established Naavick Legal in 2021. Nestled in Mumbai, Naavick Legal is a research-driven legal advisory and litigation firm with a mission to possess authoritative knowledge in corporate laws and practical command over execution. The vision of our firm is to evolve into a research-driven legal think tank capable of forecasting and resolving policy and regulatory issues in corporate laws.  Our team comprises highly motivated and technically skilled lawyers, united by a shared dedication to surpassing expectations in the delivery of legal services. With a keen focus on emerging legal trends, our firm brings a collective commitment to precision and thoroughness, ensuring exceptional legal solutions. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>â€œ</photoshop:LayerName>
